msgctxt "112"
msgid "Editorial desk. How can I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Yeah, I had a question about one of your old articles..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "I see. Go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"About three years back, you printed an article on the Millennium Tower "
"bombing in Kamurocho. Who wrote that piece?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Three years back? Oh, the Millennium Tower story..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "And you want the author, huh? Well, you're talking to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "I'm trying to find the man in that article's picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Gosh, let's see... Pretty sure that's a bigtime yakuza. They call him the "
"Dragon of Dojima, I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"No, don't worry about that guy. I need the one behind him. Kind of homeless-"
"looking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"That I don't know. We don't exactly keep track of all the random people in "
"our pictures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Besides, that was three whole years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "And there's no way to find out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "You could ask the photographer, I guess? He might know something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "One of your staff?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Actually, that specific photo we got from a contract photographer. "
"Freelancer type."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "You'll probably have better luck asking him yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "How can I get in touch with him, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "His name's Yanai, and at this time of day, let's see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "He'd be out drinking in the Champion District. A place called Shellac."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "All right. Thanks for your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "The guy you want is at Shellac. A bar in the Champion District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "The photographer, you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Name's Yanai."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "And he's at Shellac... After all these years, I've finally got a lead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Thank you so much. Now... I'm a step closer to finding that bastard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "\"That bastard\"? What, your dad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "He's finally going to get what's coming to him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Hey... What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Doesn't matter. Thanks again for everything... See you around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"(He'll \"get what's coming to him\"? Maybe I should check out Shellac "
"myself.)"
msgstr ""

